        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mizengo kūlwa Balawī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo a bataale ba kaya ja Balawī būng'wegeela ū ngabīji Elieza nū Yoshwa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nuni, na a bataale a bangī a bang'anda jingī ī ja Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jenījo balī Shilo mu sī ya Kanaani, aho baabeegeela būbawīla, “Ū SEEBA walī walagīja mu nzīla ya ng'wa Musa gīkī mutwinhe nise mizengo ya kwikala mo, hamò na madīīmīlo ga mitugo jise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a Baisilaeli būshikīlīja gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī walagīja, būbinha a Balawī kūfuma ū mu sī ja wingīji wabo mizengo īyī hamò na madīīmīlo gayo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbale ya kwandya yūbagwīla ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Kohati. A Balawī abo baalī ba shibyalīlwe sha ngabīji Alooni binhwa mizengo ikūmi n'idatū kūfuma mu banhū ba ng'anda ja ba Yuda, Simioni na Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bangī a ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Kohati bakinhwa mizengo ikūmi kūfuma mu kaya ja banhū ba ng'anda ja ba Efulaimu, Dani na nusu ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Gelishoni a bene bakinhwa mizengo ikūmi n'idatū kūfuma mu kaya ja banhū ba ng'anda ja ba Isakaali, Asheli, na Nafutali, nī nusu ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase ī ya Bashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Melali kūlenganīla nū mumo jalī ndūgū jabo banukūla mizengo ikūmi n'ībīlī kūfuma kū banhū ba ng'anda ja ba Lubeni, Gaadi, na Zabuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgabanhyiwa kwa mizengo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a Baisilaeli būbagabanhya a Balawī ī mizengo yenīyī, hamò na a madīīmīlo gayo, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī walagīja mu nzīla ya ng'wa Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu ng'anda ja ba Yuda na Simioni, bīīgaba ī mizengo īyī kūlenganīla nū mumo gaalī a mina gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ī mizengo īyī būgabīlwa Balawī ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Kohati, abo baalī ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Alooni, nguno ī mbale ya kwandya īkabagwīīla boi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma mu sī ya magūlya ga lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda, binhwa nzengo gwa Kiliati-alaba (h'ī Hebuloni) hamò na madīīmīlo gaago, (ū Alaba walī nkūlūgeji wa Baanaki). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a malaale na a magūngūli ayo gaalī gagūpīndije ū nzengo gwenūyo baalī bamala kūng'winha Kelebu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yefune kūbiza sabo yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a ba shibyalīlwe sha ngabīji Alooni binhwa Hebuloni (ūyo gwalī nzengo gwa kūpeelela ūlū munhū ūbūūlwa gīkī wabūlagaga), na Libuna, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jatili, Esitemoa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Holoni, Debili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aini, Juta, na Beti-shemeshi; mizengo kenda hamò na madīīmīlo gayo kūfuma ū mu ng'anda būbīlī wajo jenīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini binhwa mizengo ya Gibeoni, Geba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anasosi, hamò na Alimoni; mizengo īnè na madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo ya bagabīji ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Alooni ī yose yalī ikūmi n'idatū, hamò na madīīmīlo gayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī a bangī a ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Kohati bakinhwa mizengo kūfuma mu sī ya banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu sī ya magūlya ga lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu binhwa Shekemu (ūyo nago gwalī nzengo gwa kūpelela ūlū munhū ūbūūlwa gīkī wabūlagaga), na Geza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibuzaimu, na Beti-holoni; mizengo īnè hamò na madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū kūfuma ū mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Dani binhwa mizengo ya Eliteke, Gibesoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aijaloni, Gati-limoni; mizengo īnè hamò na madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū kūfuma ū mu nusu ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase banukūla Taanaki na Gati-limoni; mizengo ībīlī hamò na madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo ī yose ikūmi yenīyī hamò na a madīīmīlo gayo bakinhwa banhū ba ndūgū ja ng'wa Kohati abo baalī baasaagīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Gelishomu a bene ū kūfuma ū mu nusu ī yīngī ī ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase bakinhwa nzengo gwa Golani, mu sī ya Bashani (nago gwalī nzengo gwa kūpeelela ūlū munhū ūbūūlwa gīkī wabūlagaga), binhwa na Beeshitala; mizengo ībīlī hamò na madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū kū lūganda lwa ng'wa Isakaali banukūla Kishioni, Dabela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalimuti, na Enganimu; mizengo īnè hamò na madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū kū lūganda lwa ng'wa Asheli banukūla Mishali, Abudoni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helikati na Lehobu; mizengo īnè hamò na madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū kū lūganda lwa ng'wa Nafutali banukūla Kedeshi ya Gileadi (nago gwalī nzengo gwa kūpeelela ūlū munhū ūbūūlwa gīkī wabūlagaga), Hamosi-dooli, na Kalita; mizengo idatū hamò na madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo ī yose īyo bakinhwa banhū ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Gelishomu yaal'ikūmi n'idatū hamò na madīīmīlo gayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Melali (a Balawī abo baalī baasaagīīla) a bene ū kūfuma ū kū lūganda lwa ng'wa Zabuloni binhwa Yokineamu, Kalita, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimuna, na Nahalali; mizengo īnè hamò na madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū kū lūganda lwa Lubeni binhwa Beza, Yahazi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedemoti na Mefaati; mizengo īnè hamò na madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū kū lūganda lwa Gaadi binhwa Lamoti mu sī ya Gileadi (nago nzengo gwa kūpeelela ūlū munhū ūbūūlwa gīkī wabūlagaga), Mahanaimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heshiboni, na Yazeeli; mizengo īnè hamò na madīīmīlo gaaayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo ī yose īyo bakahelelwa banhū ba kaya ja ng'wa Melali, a Balawī abo baalī baasaagīīla, yalī ikūmi n'ībīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo ī yose ī ya Balawī ū mu sī īyo bakīdima Baisilaeli, yalī makūmi anè, n'īnaane hamò na a madīīmīlo gayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo yenīyī būlī gwene gwalī na madīīmīlo gayo, gagūpīndīlīgije; h'ūmo yaalī pyī ī mizengo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwisagīja kwa ng'wa SEEBA kūshikīīla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū SEEBA ūbiza wabinha ng'hana a Baisilaeli pyī ī sī īyo walī wabisagīja kūbinha bakūlūgenji babo, bīdima bikala mo būlembeela. Ū mu banishi babo atigelile nūūlū ūmò wa kūbīīmīla; ū SEEBA akabatūūla pye a banishi babo mu nkono gwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kwisagīja kwa ng'wa SEEBA ū kwawiza ū kū banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Isilaeli, pyī ū kose kūkashikīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūtalebile mhayo nūūlū gūmò gwaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
